      "side": 1,
      "message": "We\u0027ve already mentioned why FIVE is necessary many times to Google ART team.\nIn case of Google ART team accepted our changes and they applied vendor hook in the ART. https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/art/+/1393181\n\nhttps://issuetracker.google.com/issues/134558686 I found you\u0027re also included in this bug.\n\nRecently, we\u0027re changing a lot of things of FIVE to satisfy GKI 1.0 and 2.0 requirements.\nSo the existing source code I shared can be old one but five_dmverity code is still alive.\nAbove all, I don\u0027t know if it is good about uploading FIVE code into gerrit.",
